      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>&lt;<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;1-2 lines summarizing the <strong>child feature's&nbsp;</strong>purpose and use</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&gt;</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Used By</span></h2><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&lt;Role predominantly using the feature&gt;</span></span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How is it Used?</span></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Snippet, followed by Steps/Screenshots ONLY if the feature is widely used as-is OOTB</span></span></span></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. As the screens and workflows are not constant across all installations of Bahmni, we have refrained from prescribing them. </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Please refer to the Guides below for further details about the feature.</span></strong></p><div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></strong></div></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Feature Guide\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[<Page Name> - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-tex