      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Template:NewUserGuideFeature-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>&lt;<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> 1-2 lines summarizing the <strong>child feature's </strong>purpose and use</span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&gt;</span></p><h2 id=\"Template:NewUserGuideFeature-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&lt;Role predominantly using the feature&gt;</span></span></p><h2 id=\"Template:NewUserGuideFeature-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Snippet, followed by Steps/Screenshots ONLY if the feature is widely used as-is OOTB</span></span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. As the screens and workflows are not constant across all installations of Bahmni, we have refrained from prescribing them. </span></strong></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to the Guides below for further details about the feature.</span></strong></p><div><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br /></span></strong></div></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604183/Feature+Guide\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604183\" data-linked-resource-version=\"24\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">&lt;Page Name&gt; - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2392073/Implementer+s+Guide\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2392073\" data-linked-resource-version=\"55\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">&lt;Page Name&gt; - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><p> </p><p> </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
